<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολ-μός</span></b> , ὁ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equipment, raiment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1055
			</span></i>; but mostly with a word added, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόστερνοι ς. πέπλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλανα ς. πέπλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					216
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				923
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολμοὺς
			μελαμπέπλους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				818
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τε χρωτὸς τῶνδε . .
			πέπλων</span> over the body, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				148
			</span></i>; also of chaplets, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφέων ἱεροὺς
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				258
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				526
			</span></i>; also of sails, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολμοί τε λαίφους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					715
				</span></i>
			.</div>
